		<meta name="description" content="Morten Thomassen writes today about the fascinating situation at the 1991 Eurovision song contest when two songs ended at the same amount of points. ESC Covers google translated it from Norwegian to English. This post ends this series which has concentrated on all finals from 1975 until this year (2022). And then it is natural" />
